  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover Rothco&rsquo;s M-65 Field Jacket Liner, a warm and lightweight jacket designed for integration with our M-65 Field Jackets or as a standalone piece. The specially crafted jacket liner boasts a stylish quilted pattern and durable nylon outer material for lasting use. With the option to button it into various field jackets, this liner provides service-grade thermal insulation with a warm polyester filling. Embrace versatility and style in one with Rothco's M-65 Field Jacket Liners.</p>",
